    note for HudBossBar "布局定稿（1920x1080 参考分辨率）：<br/>  BossBar 根  anchor(0.5,1) pivot(0.5,1) pos(0,-72) size 720x64<br/>  BossName    720x24  UpperCenter<br/>  BarBg/Fill  720x28  pos(0,-28)<br/>  ★ BarFill 的 pivot.x 必须为 0，否则会从中心两头缩<br/>  TickP2 / TickP3  x = 720*0.65 / 720*0.30（与 BossPhase 阈值同源）<br/><br/>Build() 三件套：幂等守卫 → 建控件 → _root.SetActive(false)。<br/>⚠️ 测试取组件必须 GetComponentInChildren<HudBossBar>(true)，<br/>   与 P0_5_MenuHudTests.cs:20 记录的同款陷阱一致。"

    class FxAutoDespawn {
        <<T2新增 MonoBehaviour>>
        +float LifeSeconds
        -float _t
        -void OnEnable()
        -void Update()
    }
    note for FxAutoDespawn "补 CombatEventsUnity.SpawnFx 只生不灭的漏洞。<br/>P3 每 6s 一发冲击波，不回收则一局泄漏几十个空对象到 FxRoot。"

    %% =======================================================================
    %% 关系
    %% =======================================================================

    Encounter "1" *-- "1" RunPhaseTracker : readonly 持有 @148
    Encounter "1" o-- "0..*" Combatant : Combatants
    Encounter ..> BossController : CollectSummons @1045<br/>ResolveBossShockwave @1071
    RunPhaseTracker ..> Encounter : 便捷重载 @249<br/>读 PendingAwareEnemyCount
    RunPhaseTracker ..> RunPhase : 落定
    Combatant "1" o-- "0..1" BossController : AI
    BossController ..> BossPhase : Phase
    BossController ..> SpawnRequest : Spawn 委托入参
    DifficultyBridge ..> Combatant : BuildBoss @389<br/>造出 IsBoss=true

    CombatController "1" *-- "1" Encounter : BuildEncounter @118 new
    CombatController "1" *-- "1" CombatEventsUnity
    CombatController ..> DifficultyBridge : SpawnBoss @430
    CombatController ..> CombatView : AttachView @457
    CombatEventsUnity ..> BossPhase : BossPhaseChanged @69

    CombatBridge --> CombatController : 唯一编排者
    CombatBridge --> Encounter : MarkBossPending<br/>ClearBossPending
    CombatBridge ..> CombatEventsUnity : 订阅 BossPhaseChanged<br/>装配 ShockwaveFxPrefab
    CombatBridge --> HudBossBar : Show / SetPhase / Hide
    CombatBridge --> EnemySpawner : DressBoss
    CombatBridge ..> BossFlowConfig
    CombatBridge ..> BossFlowState

    WorldBuilder ..> CombatController : BindScene @729<br/>传 bossTemplate
    WorldBuilder ..> EnemySpawner
    WorldBuilder ..> FxAutoDespawn : 挂在冲击波模板上
    CombatEventsUnity ..> FxAutoDespawn : Instantiate 的副本自带

    Hud "1" *-- "1" HudBossBar : 同 GameObject 兄弟组件<br/>Build() @156 之后装配
    Hud "1" *-- "1" HudStatusIcons : 既有兄弟组件
    HudBossBar ..> BossFlowConfig : 尺寸与边距
    HudBossBar ..> BossPhase : SetPhase
    HudBossBar ..> Combatant : 读 Hp / HpMax / DisplayName
